      "value": "i feel avatars with over a million mesh partical pollygons should be maked too. i see too many super laggy avis on both pc and quest that have 1-20MIL mesh partical polygons cuz of it being an anime character or something with \"attacks\".\n\nThen a random in a public uses it and it lags the whole server. even for pc, having it as a red flag that makes it off by default would be great!",
